<title>CROATIA: Croatia January unemployment rises to 16.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Croatia January unemployment rises to 16.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State Statistics Bureau issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA UNEMPLOYMENT	 JANUARY    DECEMBER     JAN '96</p>
<p> Total jobless		  275,092     269,263     257,432</p>
<p> Unemployment rate (pct)     16.2	  15.9	  18.1</p>
<p>NOTES -- The unemployment rate fell to under 16 percent in Septeber 1996 after army, police and farmers were included in the total workforce. Figures for January 1996 were not revised. Data exclude jobless in Serb-held Eastern Slavonia region. -- Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
